+/*
+ * F1GameStation handheld (Allwinner F1C200s / "suniv") board emulation.
+ *
+ * Enough of the SoC for the MiyooCFW kernel with the F1GameStation patches
+ * and the MiyooCFW root filesystem from the SD card:
+ *   - ARM926EJ-S, 64 MiB DRAM at 0x80000000, SRAM
+ *   - suniv interrupt controller, sun4i timer, sun6i watchdog (reset)
+ *   - CCU (PLLs report lock), PIO with the 13 buttons on the host keyboard
+ *   - UART0 (debug console), SD/MMC0, and MMC1 as an optional second
+ *     card (-drive if=sd,index=1) for sharing files with the host
+ *   - DEBE layer 0 + TCON0 shown as the 480x272 panel, with vblank IRQ,
+ *     the 180 degree panel mounting and PWM1 backlight brightness
+ *   - normal DMA channel 0 feeding the audio codec, played on the host
+ *   - LRADC battery reading
+ * Everything else is an unimplemented-device stub (reads 0, logs writes
+ * with -d unimp); the SPI flash, USB OTG and video engine nodes are
+ * disabled in the DTB at load time.
+ *
